# Quiz create (`/quizzes/new`) — optional fields

## Always optional (all roles)

- **Topic** — not required; allow empty / store `0` when unset.
- **Difficulty** — not required; allow empty / store `0` when unset.

## Role-scoped ownership fields

| Role | School | Campus |
|------|--------|--------|
| **PortalAdmin** | Optional | Optional |
| **SchoolAdmin** | From token (not user-picked) | Optional |
| Teacher / Parent | From account / child context | From account / child context |

Unset school/campus for PortalAdmin (or unset campus for SchoolAdmin) persist as **NULL** (not `0`) so FK constraints to `schools` / `school_campuses` stay valid. Same for Topic / Difficulty → lookups: unset → NULL.

Do not block create for missing Topic, Difficulty, School (PortalAdmin), or Campus (PortalAdmin / SchoolAdmin).

## Still required on create

- Title, Instructions, Class, Subject
- Quiz type when the create form shows it (`requireQuizType`)
